pa_lines = Array[String](["Containment status report overdue. Sectors three through seven, verify seals.", "Reminder: unaccompanied D-Class personnel outside designated areas will be processed under Directive 12.", "The cafeteria on Floor 2 is closed until further notice.", "Maintenance request 4471: corridor lighting, Sector 3. Priority: deferred.", "If you can hear this announcement, remain where you are. Personnel will not be dispatched.", "Attention: biological signature count on Floor 3 does not match roster. Recount scheduled."])
